    {
      "id": 542,
      "title": "Midnight Prestige",
      "filename": "542.png",
      "extension": "png",
      "link": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thekhansdev/prompt-images-v1/main/images/542.png",
      "prompt": "(Use reference photo face)
A stylish young man leaning casually against a sleek white luxury car (BMW i7) parked on a modern city street at night. The background features palm trees, tall skyscrapers, and urban city lights, creating a premium metropolitan atmosphere.
He is wearing a yellow designer t-shirt (Gucci logo) layered with a half-white cargo jacket, dark gray cargo pants, and white sneakers. Accessories include a bracelet, chain necklace, wristwatch, and sunglasses.
His pose is confident and relaxed: one hand resting on the car, the other in his pocket. The car’s glossy surface reflects surrounding city lights and street reflections.
Lighting & Mood:
Nighttime cinematic lighting, London road–style bokeh lights, shallow depth of field, soft reflections, urban luxury vibe.
Style & Quality:
Ultra-realistic, cinematic photography, 8K detail, sharp focus on subject, smooth background blur, high contrast, professional color grading, luxury lifestyle aesthetic."
    },
    {
      "id": 543,
      "title": "Grand Arrival",
      "filename": "543.png",
      "extension": "png",
      "link": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thekhansdev/prompt-images-v1/main/images/543.png",
        "prompt": "Ultra-realistic cinematic 8K photograph, widescreen 16:9, set on a luxury yacht dock in Dubai Marina during neutral evening light. Crisp shadows and movie-like action capture create a premium cinematic atmosphere.
A 25-year-old elite man with glossy black hair flowing naturally steps out of a luxury car onto the dock. One hand rests on the car door while the other adjusts his sunglasses mid-motion. His body leans slightly forward, capturing the moment of a confident first step toward the yacht.
He wears a red tailored luxury suit jacket, a white open-collar shirt, and full-length relaxed khulla shalwar draped naturally over loafers with a proper break and elegant flow.
Four bodyguards move around him in natural, unaware motion:
– one scanning the surroundings
– one holding the car door
– two walking alongside
Slightly behind him, a stylish woman walks gracefully, wearing tailored pants, a black top, and a gold-embroidered vest. Her hair moves naturally with motion, one hand casually holding a bag.
Reflections of the luxury car and marina water are visible. Subtle cinematic motion blur, shallow depth of field, real-time action feel.
Photorealistic, ultra-sharp detail, cinematic color grading, luxury storytelling, high realism."
    },
    {
      "id": 544,
      "title": "Defiant Smoke",
      "filename": "544.png",
      "extension": "png",
      "link": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thekhansdev/prompt-images-v1/main/images/544.png",
        "prompt": "Extreme cinematic close-up, widescreen (16:9) frame of a young man inside a prison cell. He has side-swept dark hair, a sharp beard, and wears an orange prison jumpsuit. He smokes a cigarette as thick smoke curls and drifts across his face, partially obscuring his intense, defiant expression.
Harsh, moody lighting from a single overhead source creates deep shadows and strong contrast, highlighting facial structure and gritty skin texture.
In the wider background, out of focus, are vertical black jail bars and a prison guard standing watch, adding depth and tension to the scene.
Photorealistic, 8K resolution, cinematic film grain, dark gritty tone, high-contrast lighting, ultra-detailed realism, dramatic widescreen composition."},
    {
      "id": 545,
      "title": "Afghan Essence",
      "filename": "545.png",
      "extension": "png",
      "link": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thekhansdev/prompt-images-v1/main/images/545.png",
        "prompt": "Ultra-high-definition 8K hyper-realistic cinematic square (1:1) frame showing an Afghan girl actively pouring tea from a polished brass kettle. Steam rises naturally, catching and reflecting surrounding colors. She wears a multi-colored Perahan Tunban with bold traditional Afghan patterns, contrasting sleeves, and highly realistic fabric texture. A young man (Kinsum) stands confidently at the counter beside her, one hand resting on colorful painted wood, the other reaching forward. His glossy black hair moves dynamically with airflow, individual strands crisp and sharply defined. The environment is fully detailed and entirely in focus: bright utensils, patterned tea cups, textured walls, ground dust, background customers, and roadside tea stall elements — no blur anywhere. Lighting is vibrant natural daylight with cinematic HDR control, enhanced color depth, and crystal clarity. Camera: ultra-sharp professional capture, extreme micro-detail, polished cinematic color grading, balanced central composition."}
